FINANCIAL PLANNER V1.3 - README
-------------------------------

This file is for users of V1.2 who wish to upgrade to V1.3  New users 
should use the full instructions.

To upgrade from V1.2, simply replace the old PLAN2.APP file with the 
new S3APLAN3.APP, then uninstall V1.2 <PSION-/> and reinstall V1.3 <PSION-I>. 

Because the where so many programs around called 'PLAN', as well as changing
the title of the program I also changed the directory it uses.  To use your old
data files, just transfer them from the directory \PLAN\ to a new directory
\S3APLAN\

The following enhancements have been added.

1.	You can now change the position of the vertical lines on the screen yourself.

2.	A Jump to Month option has been added.

3.	The Cost estimate dialog now gives you more flexibility.


Hope you like the improvements

Cheers

Al
